        "username": "Jeysie",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-07-19T15:45:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I just realized that I never actually got around to mentioning this here, uh, whoops. :&gt;</p>\n<p>After seeing how all the Sentinels news seemed to be scattered all over the place, I came up with the idea of finding some way to pull all the news from all the various sources into <em>one</em> place. And ended up creating a Discord server for that purpose:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://steamcommunity.com/linkfilter/?url=https://discord.gg/pKVeAuT\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://discord.gg/YERzHyB</a></p>\n<p>It's a listen-only server;&nbsp;no actual chatting. (We have the Handelabra server, RoD, and the LP server for that anyway!) It's split up into a bunch of different categories so you can easily mute any source of news you're not particularly interested in.</p>\n<p>Fair warning that the news is not always right away; the Twitch aspect in particular has an annoying tendency to lag 48 minutes after the stream starts. So if you want stuff to be up-to-the-second you're best off following the source yourself. But it's good for casually following less time-sensitive news in one spot.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:53:59.886Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
