        "raw": "<p>I just realized that I never actually got around to mentioning this here, uh, whoops. :&gt;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>After seeing how all the Sentinels news seemed to be scattered all over the place, I came up with the idea of finding some way to pull all the news from all the various sources into <em>one</em> place. And ended up creating a Discord server for that purpose:</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://steamcommunity.com/linkfilter/?url=https://discord.gg/pKVeAuT\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://discord.gg/YERzHyB</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>It's a listen-only server;&nbsp;no actual chatting. (We have the Handelabra server, RoD, and the LP server for that anyway!) It's split up into a bunch of different categories so you can easily mute any source of news you're not particularly interested in.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Fair warning that the news is not always right away; the Twitch aspect in particular has an annoying tendency to lag 48 minutes after the stream starts. So if you want stuff to be up-to-the-second you're best off following the source yourself. But it's good for casually following less time-sensitive news in one spot.</p>",
