        "raw": "<p>Addendum that I might have been able to do a workaround that has the Twitch streams now actually announcing on time. Whoo! That was the one real time-sensitive thing so I'm glad I was able to find a fix.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Next to see if maybe there's some way I can equally pull GTG's tendency to livestream on YouTube nowadays instead of Twitch&nbsp;from the Videos channel into the Streaming channel, since I think that might now be doable with how I implemented the workaround.</p>",
